[228.97638, "o", "evt-00090 | Code: 5156 | Msg: The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.\r \r Application Information:\r \tProcess ID:\t\t3580\r \tApplication Name:\t\\device\\harddiskvolume2\r\nevt-00102 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:18:52.696\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9969-5f14-2d00-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 1980\r So\r\nevt-00104 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:18:52.696\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9969-5f14-2d00-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 1980\r So\r\nevt-00106 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:18:52.696\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9969-5f14-2d00-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 1980\r So\r\nevt-00107 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:18:52.696\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9969-5f14-2d00-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 1980\r So\r\nevt-00189 | Code: 13 | Msg: Registry value set:\r RuleName: -\r EventType: SetValue\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:18:58.758\r ProcessGuid: {b59756a9-996d-5f14-4900-000000000400}\r ProcessI\r\nevt-00197 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:19:00.008\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9966-5f14-1200-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 396\r Sou\r\nevt-00199 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:19:00.008\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9966-5f14-1200-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 396\r Sou\r\nevt-00201 | Code: 10 | Msg: Process accessed:\r RuleName: -\r UtcTime: 2020-07-22 04:19:00.008\r SourceProcessGUID: {b59756a9-9966-5f14-1200-000000000400}\r SourceProcessId: 396\r Sou\r\n"]
